      ":question/problem": "Given that $C$ and $D$ are finite, non-overlapping regions and that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\iint_{C} f(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{d}A&=-\\frac{5}{2},\\\\\\iint_{D} f(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{d}A&=\\frac{3}{2},\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfind the value of\n\n$$\n\\iint_{C\\cup D} (2)f(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{d}A.\n$$\n\n",
